WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,910 --> 00:00:10,910
Mr. Su, given your financial resources, are you interested in participating in the first land auction of Mengguishi in three days?

2
00:00:10,910 --> 00:00:14,910
If you are interested, I can help you submit an application to attend the conference.

3
00:00:14,910 --> 00:00:19,780
Detection key A new task for this auction has been released, task content.

4
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:26,780
In the first land auction conference of Mengguishi, at least one piece of land was successfully auctioned, and the cumulative consumption was no less than 300 million rail coins.

5
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:29,780
Mission rewards, ghost king and contracts.

6
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:39,040
Contract contract?

7
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:42,040
The task is completed until the auction ends.

8
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:45,040
If the timeout is not completed, the task will automatically expire.

9
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:51,140
The land at the auction has been officially verified and the property rights are clear, but the competition is also fierce.

10
00:00:51,140 --> 00:00:54,140
Several old nobles from Mengguishi will send people here.

11
00:00:54,140 --> 00:00:58,300
If Mr. Su is interested, I suggest you sign up early.
